# =====================================================================
# .gitignore  —  XYZ123 clinical development repository
# Rule: version PROGRAMS, never DATA or generated OUTPUT.
# Datasets are the system of record owned by Data Management.
# =====================================================================

# ---- SAS data & transport files (owned by Data Management) ----
*.sas7bdat
*.sas7bcat
*.sas7bndx
*.xpt
*.xpt2
*.cport

# ---- Logs & generated output ----
*.log
*.lst
*.rtf
*.pdf
output/
results/
reports/


# ---- CDISC / validation engine artefacts ----
*.xlsx
!docs/**/*.xlsx          # keep spec spreadsheets that live under docs/

# ---- OS / editor junk ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.bak
*~
